<div class="apx">

  <!-- 1. HERO -->
  <section class="apx-hero">
    <div class="apx-c">
      <div class="apx-hero-grid">
        <div class="apx-reveal">
          <span class="pill"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3Z"/></svg> Not another institute — a software company that trains engineers</span>
          <h1>Build Real Software.<br><span class="apx-grad">Build a Real Career.</span></h1>
          <p class="sub">Don't just learn programming. Train inside a real software development environment where you build applications, work on practical projects, receive mentorship, and gain professional experience before your career even begins.</p>
          
          <a class="hero-social" href="#team">
            <div class="hs-stack">
              <img src="/media/images/team/Pramod_Sharma.jpeg" alt="Pramod Sharma" loading="lazy"><img src="/media/images/team/Sampad_Kumar.jpeg" alt="Sampad Kumar" loading="lazy"><img src="/media/images/team/Mainak_Das.jpeg" alt="Mainak Das" loading="lazy"><img src="/media/images/team/Lavanya_Sandula.jpeg" alt="Lavanya Sandula" loading="lazy"><img src="/media/images/team/Deepak_Gautam.jpeg" alt="Deepak Gautam" loading="lazy"><img src="/media/images/team/Sumit_Hanchate.jpeg" alt="Sumit Hanchate" loading="lazy">
              <span class="more">+85</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cap"><b>The real team you'll build with</b><span>Mentors &amp; engineers — verify us on LinkedIn</span></div>
          </a>
          
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="#journey" class="apx-btn apx-btn-primary">Explore Programs <svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
            <a href="#projects" class="apx-btn apx-btn-ghost">See Student Projects</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-path">
            <span class="hp-label">Your journey</span>
            <div class="hp-flow">
              <span class="hp-step"><span class="num">1</span>Training</span>
              <span class="hp-arrow"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
              <span class="hp-step"><span class="num">2</span>Internship</span>
              <span class="hp-arrow"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
              <span class="hp-step"><span class="num">3</span>Real Projects</span>
              <span class="hp-arrow"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
              <span class="hp-step"><span class="num">4</span>Experience</span>
              <span class="hp-arrow"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
              <span class="hp-step"><span class="num">5</span>Career Growth</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="apx-reveal" id="contact">
          <form class="apx-formcard" method="post" action="/enquiry/">
            <input type="hidden" name="csrfmiddlewaretoken" value="JuViTe6jZjkqkueMK4GtYjzPRTKZcEeOsyGUIowTB8upkDVG25I3OBLFaWDRRPqS">
            <input type="hidden" name="source" value="hero">
            
            <h3>Start your journey</h3>
            <p class="fc-sub">Tell us a little about you — we'll reach out and guide you through the program.</p>
            <div class="apx-field"><label for="f-name">Full name</label><input class="apx-input" id="f-name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" required></div>
            <div class="apx-field"><label for="f-phone">Phone / WhatsApp</label><input class="apx-input" id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="+91 …" required></div>
            <div class="apx-field"><label for="f-email">Email <span style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;">(optional)</span></label><input class="apx-input" id="f-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@email.com"></div>
            <div class="apx-field"><label for="f-int">I'm interested in</label>
              <select class="apx-input" id="f-int" name="interest">
                <option value="Full-Stack Development">Full-Stack Development</option>
                <option value="Frontend Development">Frontend Development</option>
                <option value="Backend Development">Backend Development</option>
                <option value="Python">Python</option>
                <option value="Data / AI">Data / AI</option>
                <option value="Internship">Internship</option>
                <option value="Not sure yet">Not sure yet — guide me</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="apx-btn apx-btn-primary">Request a callback <svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z"/><path d="M22 2 11 13"/></svg></button>
            <p class="fc-fine">No spam. We'll only contact you about your learning journey.</p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="apx-trust">
      <div class="apx-c">
        <div class="ti"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 18 6-6-6-6"/><path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6"/></svg><div><b>You build, not just watch</b><span>Learn by shipping real software</span></div></div>
        <div class="ti"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg><div><b>Inside a real dev team</b><span>Mentorship &amp; collaboration</span></div></div>
        <div class="ti"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg><div><b>Real people, verifiable</b><span>Our team is public on LinkedIn</span></div></div>
        <div class="ti"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 20a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.69-.9L9.6 3.9A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2Z"/></svg><div><b>Graduate with a portfolio</b><span>Proof of real work</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. WHY MOST STUDENTS STRUGGLE -->
  <section class="apx-sec">
    <div class="apx-c">
      <div class="apx-head apx-reveal">
        <span class="apx-tag"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg> The real problem</span>
        <h2>Why most students struggle after finishing courses</h2>
        <p>You can complete a programming course and still freeze in interviews — because knowing syntax isn't the same as having worked like a software developer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="apx-cards g3">
        <div class="apx-card apx-reveal"><div class="apx-ic soft"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg></div><h4>They know syntax, not systems</h4><p>Courses teach concepts. Real software means building complete, working applications end to end.</p></div>
        <div class="apx-card apx-reveal"><div class="apx-ic soft"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h4>They've never worked on a team</h4><p>No collaboration, no code reviews, no shared codebase — the everyday reality of professional software work.</p></div>
        <div class="apx-card apx-reveal"><div class="apx-ic soft"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"/><path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="M3.3 7 12 12l8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg></div><h4>They've never shipped anything real</h4><p>Without real projects and real development workflows, confidence never gets a chance to form.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. LEARN THE WAY SOFTWARE COMPANIES WORK + before/after -->
  <section class="apx-sec apx-bg2">
    <div class="apx-c">
      <div class="apx-head apx-reveal">
        <span class="apx-tag"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3Z"/></svg> The difference</span>
        <h2>Learn the way software companies <span class="apx-grad-ink">actually work</span></h2>
        <p>At AplusTopper, learning doesn't stop at theory. You work inside a professional development environment — building, collaborating and solving real problems until the skills are truly yours.</p>
      </div>
