  <!-- 11. FAQ -->
  <section class="apx-sec">
    <div class="apx-c">
      <div class="apx-head apx-reveal">
        <span class="apx-tag"><svg class="ic-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg> Good questions</span>
        <h2>Things students ask us</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="apx-faq apx-reveal">
        <details class="apx-q"><summary>Is this a course or real work experience?</summary><div class="a">Both — but the emphasis is experience. You learn the fundamentals, then apply them by building real software inside a real development team. You finish having actually done the work, not just studied it.</div></details>
        <details class="apx-q"><summary>I'm a complete beginner. Is that okay?</summary><div class="a">Yes. You start with fundamentals, guided by mentors, and move on to real project work when you're ready. Everyone begins somewhere.</div></details>
        <details class="apx-q"><summary>What will I have at the end?</summary><div class="a">Practical skills, professional experience, a real portfolio, and the confidence that comes from having built software the way companies actually do.</div></details>
        <details class="apx-q"><summary>Is the internship real?</summary><div class="a">Yes. You join the team and take on real tasks with real responsibility and feedback — the bridge between learning and working professionally.</div></details>
        <details class="apx-q"><summary>Do you guarantee a job?</summary><div class="a">No, and we won't pretend to. What we give you is real experience, a real portfolio and real skills — the things that genuinely help you get hired and keep growing.</div></details>
        <details class="apx-q"><summary>How do I get started?</summary><div class="a">Fill in the short form on this page or message us on WhatsApp. We'll reach out, understand where you are, and walk you through the journey.</div></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 12. FINAL CTA -->
